  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "proved",
  "scope": "For every pair of integers n >= 13 and w > n-1, let V_{n,w}=({1,2,...,n-1}\\{12}) union {w} and LR(V)=max_{0<=t<1} min_{v in V} ||vt||. Then LR(V_{n,w})=1/n if and only if (n,w)=(14,24). Moreover, LR(V_{14,24})=1/14; for the 20 pairs remaining after the cited theorem-based exhaustion, the exact LR value is respectively one of 2/59, 2/61, 2/65, or 2/67 as itemized in the evidence.",
